  "assumptions": [
    "Chosen format: 4:3, with a 128×96 logical canvas and an eight-second seamless spell cycle.",
    "The required local gsap.min.js is the sole library dependency. Deterministic timeline sampling replaces the creator's autonomous requestAnimationFrame loop; the host controls playback and repetition.",
